        "notes": "# Power\n[Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) this power will be your best friend all game. You can get some value with it now, but it will shine in rounds 3+.\n\n# Items\nDamage and armor. Standard build. You could go [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) plus [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) if you are really scared of the opponent's comp.\n\n# Playstyle\nPretty much your standard soldier gameplay but with an extra tool. In early rounds you actually want to focus a little bit on aiming your helix rockets rather than only chucking them out for the visor since your pulse rifle damage is still building up.",
