        "notes": "# Items\n\nThe build is pretty flexible. Try to get the most weapon power + attack speed that you can afford and throw in some defensive items when you have extra cash. [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is very good value against any tank with armor/shields especially if they also have Zen, Juno, or armored Mei. [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) is generally a highly valuable item but you can skip it if cash is low. Never get it when you could replace it with  [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) plus [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or some other better combo of cheaper items.",
