        "notes": "# Power\n[Peripheral Pulse](item_f024f11e-2fff-40cf-9e2d-fbaa21fa1371) is the perfect complement [Super Visor](item_b3db0ab0-26b4-4d99-893d-175f6726c9e9) in this weapon power only build.\n\n# Items\nDepending on your cash, just buy the best combination of rare damage items.\n\n# Playstyle\nYou can do some serious damage with visor now. Try to use rockets and much as possible, dealing lots of damage with the double visor attacks and farming your ult. Try to find angles to hit both their supports or a dps and a support. Another good strat is hitting at least one person with armor/shields during the visor to get attack speed you can use on both targets if you have [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66). Don't stray too far from your supports if the enemies can dive you.",
