        "notes": "# Power\n[Chaingun](item_311b58a8-4cdf-480a-ba7a-0b69e6b77e3d) is not amazing since if you sprint, reload, ult, rocket, or anything it will reset the counter. However, it will always give some weapon power and that is not something you can usually get with powers. This power becomes more effective with magazine capacity and especially attack speed.\n\n# Items\n[Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f) bascially gives 10% weapon power and 10% attack speed which is amazing value in terms of dps/dollar. Not to mention you can apply the debuff to multiple targets at once during visor.\n\n# Playstyle\nDon't force plays around chaingun, but do be aware to not stop shooting when finishing off kills if possible.",
