        "created_at": "2025-07-15T01:46:41.543686+00:00",
        "notes": "# Power\n[Man on the Run](item_26b054fc-d1f6-4361-8365-c632efe11582) is somewhat of a meme, but you are going to be sprinting a lot anyway so why not get a bigger magazine which gives more left click uptime and more potential chaingun stacks. [On Me!](item_cd2a0247-bc79-4f0b-b9ee-d985e3f9a9a7) might also be ok, but that's kinda lame without much ability power. [Man on the Run](item_26b054fc-d1f6-4361-8365-c632efe11582) can actually be very good when combined with your ultimate.\n\n# Items\n[Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) gives damage and more mini visors. [Commander's Clip](item_ff7cad01-2065-4908-a2c1-3bdf1458c7a4) is kinda like [Pulse Converter](item_a93a8a8e-28d1-4b02-8d80-3234f9eea3dc) and it works well with [Man on the Run](item_26b054fc-d1f6-4361-8365-c632efe11582).\n\n# Playstyle\nAgain, don't force your playstyle around the power. But do try to build up a big magazine before ulting if you have the opportunity to do so. If you can build up a big magazine make sure you do not reload and instead use your ult. If you run out of ammo and start to reload you will lose all your bonus max ammo. Use your ult when you have a few bullets left to refresh the entire magazine.",
